## Routing Guidelines

1. For each user request, first infer which domains are relevant.
2. Select 0–3 rules/skills that best match the request, prefer the SINGLE most specific one when possible.
3. Game combat / zombies / weapons → `enemy-ai` or `gameplay-programming` or `combat-design`.
4. Progression / upgrades → `roguelike-progression` then `game-balancing`.
5. If both security and performance apply, prioritize `security.mdc` first, then `performance-optimization`.
6. Visuals / characters / zombie models / animation → `build-rigged-game-assets` + `build-game-monster-system`; FPS / horde scale → `optimize-threejs-games` first.
7. If no rule clearly matches, ignore all rules and answer normally.
